#include "hshs46.dtsi"

&kscan0 {
    compatible = "zmk,kscan-mock";
    exit-after = <0>;
};
```

Then create another new file called `hshs46_dongle.conf` with this content:
```
CONFIG_ZMK_SPLIT=y
CONFIG_ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL=y
CONFIG_ZMK_USB=y
CONFIG_BT_CTLR_TX_PWR_PLUS_8=y
